    "answer": {
      "short": "$y=(2x-1)^{3/2}$, $y'=3\\sqrt{2x-1}$.",
      "worked": "$\\begin{align*}y&=(2x-1)(2x-1)^{1/2}\\\\y&=(2x-1)^{3/2}\\\\y'&=\\frac{3}{2}(2x-1)^{1/2}(2)\\\\y'&=3\\sqrt{2x-1}.\\end{align*}$",
